fused_trimul.py derives from common/opt_core/opt_core/kernels/fpf_trimul_v4/kernels.py in
https://github.com/anthropics/uplifting-biomolecular-modeling (commit f4f62fa), Apache License 2.0.
Modified for DeepFold3: pointer kernels only; batch-limit, bias, residual and descriptor paths removed;
launch cells reduced to a table keyed by compute capability; bf16 rounding kept as upstream.

